Anyone cloning this project just needs to:

# Backend setup
cd backend
npm install
npm run setup    # Creates database + runs migrations
npm run dev

# Frontend setup (new terminal)
cd frontend  
npm install
npm start



If someone wants friends to connect from other devices, they can:

Find their IP: ifconfig | grep "inet " (Mac) or ipconfig (Windows)
Update .env:

REACT_APP_API_URL=http://YOUR_IP_HERE:3000
REACT_APP_WS_URL=http://YOUR_IP_HERE:3000